  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MTC ATM Project - Management and Technical Cooperation for the AIDS, Tuberculosis, Malaria Prevention and Control</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of this MTC ATM Project is to strengthened national and subnational level capacities to promote inclusive local development and service delivery for AIDS, Tuberculosis, and Malaria. To achieve this, the project focus on two outputs, namely: 1.	Effective Global Fund (GF) resources utilization for the intended purposes of project implementation, reporting, and closure that is more improved compliant with GF guidelines, policies, and procedures2.	Improved national health system govern</narrative>
  </description>
